OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal encampment waste 'worst
OL,4,Aseen' in 15 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council director has said that 18
OL,7,Ftonnes of waste was left at an illegal
OL,8,Fencampment when it was vacated.
OL,10,F"There was a multitude of waste -
OL,11,Fprobably the worst waste we have ever
OL,12,Fseen in traveller evictions for this
OL,13,Fcouncil," said Scott Mason, director of
OL,14,Famenities at Bridgwater Town Council.
OL,16,FMason said staff spent days clearing
OL,17,F"multiple heaps" of rubbish, such as
OL,18,Fsofas and washing machines, after the
OL,19,Fgroup left the site at Whitegates
OL,20,Fbeauty spot in Wembdon, Somerset, on 15
OL,21,FAugust, having been there since 4
OL,22,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
